<title>SWEDEN: Swedish July trade surplus 9.5 billion crowns.</title>
<headline>Swedish July trade surplus 9.5 billion crowns.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's July trade surplus was 9.5 billion crowns, Statistics Sweden said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> SWEDISH TRADE BALANCE     July 96    June 96    July 95</p>
<p> Exports			 38.5	 49.3	  n/a</p>
<p> Imports			 29.0	 34.3	  n/a</p>
<p> Trade balance		 +9.5	+15.0	 +7.3</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of crowns. Analysts polled by Reuters had forecast a 9.7 billion crown surplus.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, 46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
